From: Adam Hillson <598804+BadAd84@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] lanes: TF_GLM_OVN_PLAIN_MARGIN, the draft-over-plain margin as a knob

ai-engine 59604d959 applied onto the pin stack (two conflicts, both unions). The
core's Config gains `plain_margin` (unset: the core's 1.05, asserted by the source's
own test), and GLM's facts() reads TF_GLM_OVN_PLAIN_MARGIN in hundredths, so a
drafted depth must beat plain rounds' tokens a ms by that much. Knob unset: the value
is 0 and the core's constant stands, so every launch and every decision is unchanged.

The source commit also carried a TF_GLM_OVN_DRAFT_FIXED arm in the same facts()
block; that knob is a separate lever and is left out here, so the pin's
draft_confidence line stands unchanged.

Gates on pin+0001..0012: check-native-cuda-host green, test-lane-api-host green,
whole-tree fmt green, lean base-vs-head 0 new.

Re-seated on v1.2.7 (93a2e93ecebff8aa52b88e58c5dd222516e69c5f, from pin 9c9bf542) by the 2026-11-12 re-seat (work/reseat/DECISIONS.md):
- lean_check.py's DIRECT_GETENV/HIDDEN_GETENV: every TF_* setting this patch reads is a row of platform/environment.zig with a line in docs/environment.md, read through cuda.ovn or environment, never getenv. Row: TF_GLM_OVN_PLAIN_MARGIN (u64, hundredths).
- facts() is v1.2.7's (6d4191a95, d7d559944, 55a95af06, cc2fa8d23): the plain_margin field follows its shared_drafts line, one line with its comment. The core default moved to depth_constants.zig:9 (Constants.plain_margin 1.05); config.zig's Model/Config lines apply unchanged.
- source: work/fold/0016-plain-margin.patch

diff --git a/docs/environment.md b/docs/environment.md
index 270f8c5aaf01af52da48f12ebcaaa333f05dd9ba..d0eb6c4e9f122618201abfbf44cf8177c1814acd 100644
--- a/docs/environment.md
+++ b/docs/environment.md
@@ -56,6 +56,7 @@ Diagnostics quote and escape the supplied text so it cannot create another termi
 | `TF_GLM_OVN_INDEX_SCHED` | Exactly `0` or `1`; default off (the prompt scorer takes production's schedule) |
 | `TF_GLM_OVN_POOLS32` | Exactly `0` or `1`; default off (pool gathers in int32) |
 | `TF_GLM_OVN_INDEX_REGROUP` | Exactly `0` or `1`; default off (prompt launches score with the reduce-scatter head sum) |
+| `TF_GLM_OVN_PLAIN_MARGIN` | Whole number of hundredths a drafted depth must beat plain rounds' tokens a ms by; default 0 (the core's 1.05) |
 | `TF_PROMPT_ROWS` | Native serving: a multiple of 16 from 128 through 2048; unset keeps the chip/family default |
 | `TF_ANE_COLUMNS` | Whole u32 count; zero disables the experimental share; default zero |
 | `TF_FLASHNEXT_SCALE_INDEX` | Flash Next on Metal before tensor units: exactly `0` or `1`; `1` has the 4-bit expert kernels read each group's scale and bias through a 16-bit index into its tensor's table of pairs, the same values with fewer weight bytes; default 0 |
diff --git a/zig/src/core/lanes/config.zig b/zig/src/core/lanes/config.zig
